{{define "subject"}}Activate your account{{end}}

{{define "plainBody"}}
Hello,

Thanks for registering. Use this token to activate your account:

{{.ActivationToken}}

Activate by making a PUT request to /v1/tokens/activation with the token
as the "token" field of a JSON object.

The token expires in 3 days. If you did not register, you can ignore
this email.
{{end}}

